     "title": "»redomatic«",
     "href": "/sk/produkty/technika-zmrstovania/redomatic",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»redomatic«</h3> <p>»redomatic« je špičkové riešenie pre automatické meranie, nastavovanie a zmršťovanie.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/4/csm_smartCheck_704ca1e175.webp",
